  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Canasta. 108-card (2-deck + 4 Jokers). Partnership meld game. Wild: Jokers + 2s. Canasta = 7-card meld (Natural=500, Mixed=300). Initial meld minimum varies by score. Target: 5000 pts. Must have 1 canasta to go out.',
    Player: "You hold 3 natural 7s and a Joker. You can meld 7-7-7-Joker (4-card meld, 30+50+5+5+5=95 base points). Is your partnership's score above 1500? If so, your initial meld minimum is 90 pts. This meld qualifies! Go for it.",
    objective: 'Score 5000 points across multiple rounds by building melds, especially canastas (7-card melds).',
    gameplay: 'Draw from stock or take discard pile (if top matches meld). Meld 3+ same rank; canasta = 7+ card meld. Jokers and 2s wild. Red 3s: lay face-up, draw replacement. Opening meld: 50/90/120 pts by team score. Go out: meld all, discard last. Target 5000.',
